1
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:42,530
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:47,590
[Episode 7 He may not want to see me]

3
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:55,600
Chunsheng,

4
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,960
I heard Miss Xie
is leaving Shencheng tonight.

5
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:25,880
Nanfeng,

6
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,340
have you made up your mind?

7
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,400
Yes,

8
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,720
I've thought it through.

9
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:31,720
I'm already on my way to the airport.

10
00:01:31,960 --> 00:01:32,400
Okay.

11
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,160
You'll definitely shine brightly here.

12
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,289
Welcome to America.

13
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,500
Chu Chunsheng,

14
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,930
thank you for your love.

15
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:43,200
But I can't let it hold me back.

16
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:46,000
Once I've built my own career,

17
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:48,800
only then can I return your feelings.

18
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,740
This is my girlfriend,

19
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:21,850
Xie Nanfeng.

20
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,760
Do you believe me?

21
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:28,880
I do.

22
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,880
Why didn't you tell me?

23
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,930
From now on, we're even.

24
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:35,240
We don't need to keep score like this.

25
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,600
We have to.

26
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,620
She asked me for 100,000 dollars,

27
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:41,600
as a reward for leaving you.

28
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:43,000
Why?

29
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,600
Why?

30
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,370
Why are you leaving?

31
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:48,620
Is it because of my mom?

32
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:07,890
[1996]

33
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:23,960
Mom,

34
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,290
it's just as beautiful here as in America.

35
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:32,600
Shencheng is where Mommy grew up.

36
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,280
You'll slowly grow to like it here.

37
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:38,920
Mom,

38
00:03:38,990 --> 00:03:42,030
is your good friend here too?

39
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:46,600
Yeah.

40
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,000
Of course.

41
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,600
Are we going to see him?

42
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,800
He might not

43
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,400
want to see me.

44
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,720
A family that thinks my future
is only worth 100,000

45
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,260
will never be worthy of me.

46
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,120
Hello,

47
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:35,159
I'm Xie Nanfeng.

48
00:04:35,159 --> 00:04:36,920
I have an appointment with Director Liu
from the Management Committee.

49
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,760
Director Liu is attending a wedding
in the 3rd-floor banquet hall.

50
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:40,360
You can go upstairs and find him.

51
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,000
Thanks.

52
00:04:45,030 --> 00:04:47,580
[Bride Ms. Lin Shuang and
groom Mr. Chang Yongbin]

53
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,880
Lin Shuang,

54
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:53,320
you finally married into
the Chang family of your dreams.

55
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,840
But do you really know

56
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,900
what kind of person Chang Yongbin is?

57
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:58,500
What kind of monster he is?

58
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,400
Baby,

59
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,440
Mommy

60
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,800
has some business to discuss.

61
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,130
Be a good boy
and wait here for Mommy, okay?

62
00:05:38,930 --> 00:05:39,930
Enjoy yourself!

63
00:05:40,030 --> 00:05:41,630
Thank you so much for coming!

64
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,400
Xie Nanfeng!

65
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,000
It really is you.

66
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,930
Where have you been these past five years?

67
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,800
Don't tell me

68
00:06:03,650 --> 00:06:05,850
you regret giving up Yongbin back then?

69
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,600
Are you left-handed?

70
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,320
Are you too?

71
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,200
Yeah.

72
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:47,159
Is it your wedding today?

73
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,800
Are you all by yourself?

74
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,200
Where are your mom and dad?

75
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:56,360
I think you could be my mom's husband.

76
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:24,720
Xie Nanfeng,

77
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:28,140
are you jealous seeing me
in this wedding dress?

78
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:29,330
This dress

79
00:07:29,350 --> 00:07:31,270
was designed by me.

80
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,720
And Yongbin's factory is even going to

81
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:37,050
open a design production line just for me.

82
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,720
Designed by you?

83
00:07:43,440 --> 00:07:44,680
Lin Shuang,

84
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:47,200
it's been so many years,

85
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:49,280
and you're still just copying me.

86
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:52,200
Don't you have any new tricks?

87
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:54,240
Can't you design something new?

88
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,000
This is my original design!

89
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,040
Stop making false accusations!

90
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:00,280
Original design?

91
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,680
The style of this dress,

92
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:05,320
the design of the hem,

93
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,210
the look of the neckline...

94
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:09,650
you copied everything quite thoroughly.

95
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,480
I didn't copy you!

96
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:13,280
I just...

97
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,880
drew inspiration
from an American designer brand.

98
00:08:14,880 --> 00:08:16,200
It's Lumina's style.

99
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,920
Had I known you loved Lumina so much,

100
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:19,960
I would've given you an authentic piece

101
00:08:19,960 --> 00:08:22,800
to save you the embarrassment
of wearing a knockoff.

102
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:23,320
You...

103
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:24,840
But it's fine.

104
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:26,800
When you get married for the second time,

105
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,200
I'll just gift you
a haute couture edition.

106
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,040
You're cursing me?

107
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,000
You bitch!

108
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,080
You're just a broke beggar playing rich!

109
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,320
Lumina, my foot!

110
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,450
You're just a fraud!

111
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,840
Alright, alright!

112
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,890
It's our big day.

113
00:08:39,289 --> 00:08:39,960
Big day!

114
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,159
Okay, that's enough.

115
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:44,200
Nothing to see here.

116
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,800
Xie Nanfeng,

117
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,160
five years no see,

118
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:51,200
and you haven't changed a bit.

119
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,000
Look at you.

120
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,840
What's with that hair?

121
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,320
And the clothes...

122
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:57,000
What are you even wearing?

123
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,280
Lu-whatever?

124
00:08:58,400 --> 00:09:01,320
What do international brands
have to do with you?

125
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,320
Ms. Xie!

126
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,960
You're finally here!

127
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:05,720
Look at this.

128
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,600
Director Liu.

129
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,200
Hold on a sec,

130
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:07,960
Manager Chang.

131
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:08,800
Ms. Xie,

132
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,300
I am so sorry.

133
00:09:10,330 --> 00:09:11,600
It's my fault today.

134
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:12,680
I didn't think it through.

135
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:13,770
[Chief Liu of the Reform Management Committee of Shencheng]

136
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,320
Look.

137
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:14,000
I wanted to

138
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:15,600
send someone to pick you up.

139
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,440
I didn't expect you
to come here by yourself.

140
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,080
Sorry,

141
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,200
it's my fault.

142
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,400
Director Liu, you...

143
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,720
you're calling her...

144
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,520
Ms. Xie?

145
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:24,660
This is

146
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:27,400
Ms. Xie Nanfeng, CEO of Lumina.

147
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,400
A talent like Ms. Xie, who is capable

148
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,720
and still cares about Shencheng,

149
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:35,120
is exactly
what we're desperately looking for!

150
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,480
You're too kind, Director Liu.

151
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,080
I came back to Shencheng

152
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:41,210
with plans to contract
Shencheng First Garment Factory

153
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:45,120
to contribute to the development
of my hometown.

154
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:45,800
Excellent!

155
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,400
Yongbin.

156
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:49,600
Yongbin!

157
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,120
Isn't the First Garment Factory ours?

158
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:52,560
How can she...

159
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,200
It's fine.

160
00:09:55,260 --> 00:09:57,010
I'm the manager of this factory.

161
00:09:57,010 --> 00:09:58,930
What happens here is up to me.

162
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,970
The contracting rights of the factory

163
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,520
are not up to you.

164
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,320
It depends on the will of the masses,

165
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:08,720
and more importantly, it must
comply with national policies.

166
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,520
Not to mention,

167
00:10:09,520 --> 00:10:10,680
you want to give
a production line to a designer

168
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:12,680
who plagiarizes others.

169
00:10:12,760 --> 00:10:15,040
That completely fails national standards.

170
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,120
It's totally irresponsible!

171
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,320
Right, Director Liu?

172
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,000
Director Liu,

173
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,880
I didn't!

174
00:10:20,880 --> 00:10:22,440
Don't listen to her nonsense!

175
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,320
I never planned
to open any production line.

176
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,400
She's framing me!

177
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,240
What are you talking about?

178
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,080
Chang Yongbin!

179
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:27,760
You promised me!

180
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:28,440
You lied to me again!

181
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,360
You're making me
look like a fool in front of everyone!

182
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,320
You bastard!

183
00:10:31,320 --> 00:10:32,280
Shut your mouth!

184
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,880
We'll talk about this at home.

185
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,410
Let's go.

186
00:10:35,550 --> 00:10:36,080
Make way, everyone.

187
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:36,680
Excuse me.

188
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,710
What about my production line?

189
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,800
Director Liu,

190
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,400
I won't bother you any further today.

191
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,520
As for the factory contract,

192
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,680
when you have time later,

193
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,540
let's discuss it in person, okay?

194
00:10:48,640 --> 00:10:49,400
Ms. Xie,

195
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:51,080
I actually have time right now.

196
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:51,880
How about

197
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,360
we go talk in private?

198
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:54,120
Sure.

199
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,000
After you.
